{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：19:40 2026-11-04 HKT<br/>發佈時間：19:40 2026-11-04 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：19:40 2026-11-04 HKT</p><img alt=\"「鑽得勝」飛到馬到\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/4a08e39b6eb9613539fa4abfa533f74d/2026-11/r2_0.jpg\"/><p>今季轉投游達榮馬房的「鑽得勝」，前仗在谷草一六五○米跑第二後，今晚再跑同程，即使排在十二檔，但入閘前的獨贏賠率跌至四點一倍，結果飛到馬到，在騎師金誠剛胯下，改以主動方式發揮，結果就此一放到底勝岀。</p><p>賽後練馬師游達榮說:「『鑽得勝』今仗的際遇比上星期跑泥地好得多，上場雖然形勢平平，未能令馬兒展示天生前速，但表現都不錯，因此安排馬匹匆匆再戰。今仗轉爭谷草，排十二檔起步，幸好可以成功搶放，騎師金誠剛發揮得很好，牠的性能不限於泥地，暫時部署牠主攻快活谷。」</p><h2>按下圖睇更多相片：</h2><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/34448ad86cb68694a02971277eeeeb37/2026-11/1b494dd1-d80d-4f40-9619-9cc2ea7fa0b8.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a4b10b116af9931a859d1cd9327aa265/2026-11/4e24cd37-e054-4f67-805c-cc051b0ab4a7.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/c3f04c105c4bd4235a0b7f77bc66e8e3/2026-11/16e473e9-0620-42dd-b62e-4d896b10b055.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/fa45ecdbf1bd2a06eae667099651bc12/2026-11/71aa49b6-3a3c-4aa7-bf62-a0821d97be69.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/9b7beaa751ae97f0cd2e087ba4cfb6d9/2026-11/103cb6d7-3ae1-4077-9944-c4ae6d6569b0.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/468ea061049db619a6651f4a360c1ac2/2026-11/2914b3e6-4b86-4c23-b3eb-619cc001f136.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/53c6837573e6f8afaf378d4329f775ba/2026-11/7810afa6-8f41-4155-8d5a-162e2964d8ba.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/87902fcff9b4dd30750b3893a862ac03/2026-11/a4b3ab60-902d-44ba-8998-320aa09764d5.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/377670eb8e736ee2d7211e0fbfc30778/2026-11/aadc84ac-bc10-4c5d-ae5c-38ca42c13ae7.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/70533da0078d277d2bbb330e2dbbdfb3/2026-11/b45f4c5c-2b2f-4316-8215-2892fbe8ac08.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/93eb9c3667e592f38f77307a17dc46ed/2026-11/cd3c38a8-1b56-4a0e-a9b6-283d08cf0188.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/833736a89ad7e34958fab0d0d166f6da/2026-11/df0b9fe5-c972-4ffa-ad3d-8889858e926b.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/4d07889f2f862f033e1eb4911c236e5f/2026-11/e2a4701a-7441-47f7-9e09-16dc741cdfe0.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/21adaef36f4948855be75420236c9f7f/2026-11/e01839fd-41e7-4710-9fd8-31e1b92cb422.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/c60ca5bf3ba699c2ead551ab7b515ef3/2026-11/f53d4912-891d-40db-9505-1ebc5ac12286.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T12:05:28.706723+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":319,"images":16,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T11:40:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T18:58:45.394430+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T11:58:42.579615+00:00","content_hash":"1e7c4103ce866740d96cd5dcc0e8d6bf367e47888da3743af43ce3a424842e9c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}